    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96398" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>making watertight</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἱεροποΐου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).165.7
				</span></i>
			 (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>): pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1116.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>making close</i> or <i>costive, checking of natural
				evacuations</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.115
				</span></i>
			; <i>stoppage of the pores</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.218
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Syn.</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαύνωσις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.238
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στένωσις</span>.</div>
